592186383404 1145 "The standard equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at the origin is\n\n$$\n\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nFor a vertical hyperbola centered at the origin, the equations of the asymptotes are\n\n$$\ny=\\pm \\frac{a}{b}x.\n$$\n\nTo rewrite the given equation in standard form, we divide both sides of the equation by $400$ and then simplify, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}25{y}^{2}-16{x}^{2} & =400 \\\\ \\frac{25{y}^{2}}{400}-\\frac{16{x}^{2}}{400} & =\\frac{400}{400} \\\\ \\frac{{y}^{2}}{16}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{25} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have $a=\\sqrt{16}=4$ and $b=\\sqrt{25}=5.$\n\nTherefore, the asymptotes of the hyperbola are $y=\\pm \\frac{4}{5}x.$" 13194139536098 true] [17592186383405 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383406 13194139536098 true] [17592186383405 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383407 13194139536098 true] [17592186383405 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383408 13194139536098 true] [17592186383405 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383409 13194139536098 true] [17592186383405 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383410 13194139536098 true] [17592186383405 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536098 true] [17592186383405 1041 "selection" 13194139536098 true] [17592186383405 1104 #edb/ref 17592186383407 13194139536098 true] [17592186383405 1110 #uuid "a9bbe063-332d-53d2-bea7-9f9db3c21476" 13194139536098 true] [17592186383406 1034 "y=\\pm \\frac{5}{4}x" 13194139536098 true] [17592186383406 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536098 true] [17592186383406 1111 #uuid "4f8df0e0-fb92-59d8-a6e3-0b59b8280196" 13194139536098 true] [17592186383407 1034 "y=\\pm \\frac{4}{5}x" 13194139536098 true] [17592186383407 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536098 true] [17592186383407 1111 #uuid "ebce7f12-0bbc-554f-b8cc-e4d5db04890a" 13194139536098 true] [17592186383408 1034 "y=\\pm \\frac{5}{2}x" 13194139536098 true] [17592186383408 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536098 true] [17592186383408 1111 #uuid "9f392129-5a3a-58c2-8515-50369f20c1f5" 13194139536098 true] 